  "name": "Update Devices",
  "description": "Update Devices in Nautobot",
  "folder": "Gallery",
  "visibility": "private",
  "notes": "# Update Devices\n\n## Purpose\nThis workflow checks get the device list from nautobot and uses the \"Extract Facts\" step of batfish to get update the devices.\n\n## Assumptions / prerequisites\n* credentials: 'cisco - noc' credentials\n* inventory: 'LAB' (that is the correct name of the inventory, not only the device named LAB)\n* nautobot: the default nautobot source\n* batfish: the default batfish source\n* mattermost; the default mattermost source; team_name is 'Manus'; channel _name is 'manus' \n\n## Gotchas\n* batfish is required\n* Fan out is used in \"Get from Nautoot\" and after the workflow has all running configs, a Fan In is is used; batfish requires all devices at once\n* Interfaces are updated as well\n\n",
